  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><em>Dotting every corner of the world, the sapien are by far the most spread and traveled of all of Ardor’s races. Tall, short, stout, thin with a diverse range of hair and skin colors, they are a colorful and diverse people that share many similarities with each other compared to other races. They bring with them a stout and hardy immunity and sheer determination to make any land home, and they have succeeded. They are firm believers of their own existence, and fight to make themselves known. Whether they are the aggressors or the aggressed, they persist despite all odds in ways that would make the fiercest loupain bow their head.</em></p><p>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.journals.JournalEntry.HO16IW50jXn58kdN.JournalEntryPage.17X2Z5yhWFfCvnXH]{Sapien}</p>"
